  "result": "Fixed the bug. The issue was in the `notify` function in `src/server/services/notification-service.ts`. \n\nThe function was notifying all recipients in the watchers list, including the actor who performed the action. I added a check to skip creating a notification when the recipient is the same as the actor:\n\n```typescript\nif (recipientId === payload.actorId) continue;\n```\n\nNow when a user comments on an issue they're assigned to, they won't receive a notification about their own action, but other watchers (the issue author and other assignees) will still be notified as expected.",
